# UX workflow: verify Step Editor State refreshes immediately.
# Purpose: captures State On -> Off -> On without moving NAV focus between edits.

0 scenario sequencer
50 capture screen sequencer_ready

# Toggle the first visible step on, then open its Step Editor.
150 tap MACRO_1 60
300 button MACRO_1 down
1350 tick
1400 capture screen state_on_initial
1450 button MACRO_1 up

# Edit State directly with OPT while focus remains on State.
1550 encoder OPT -1
1650 capture screen state_off_after_opt

1750 encoder OPT 1
1850 capture screen state_on_after_opt

1950 tap LEFT_TOP 60
2150 capture screen step_edit_closed
